# DOC-05 clean-install run, 2026-11-04 (branch codex/lane-p2-docs, from origin/main)
# Fresh venv: uv venv -p 3.11; uv pip install '<checkout>[full]' kb-python==0.30.2 (local disk, /tmp).
# The conda env on PATH after the venv supplies only STAR, samtools, Rscript, dustmasker, blast, cd-hit, minimap2.
# kallisto, bustools, kb and snakemake come from the venv (the kb-python wheel bundles kallisto 0.52.0 and bustools).
# Input: tests/data/evidence_tiny (reference.fasta, combined.gtf, R1/R2.fastq); Mode 2 of docs/reference_panel.md.
# Not run: quickstart Step 1 (build-ref needs an NCBI contact email and an Ensembl download) and Mode 3 (-acc).

